AE2 Crystal Science: Legacy
===========================

This is an unofficial Minecraft 1.12.2 / Cleanroom port of Applied
Energistics: Crystal Science. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the
original AECS authors or the Applied Energistics 2 team.

