Port
----

Minecraft 1.12.2 port and modifications:
- Copyright (c) 2026 KleinBlue

The port changes APIs and implementation details for Minecraft 1.12.2,
Cleanroom Loader, Forge's ore dictionary, NBT-based item data, legacy GUI and
networking APIs, and AE2 Supergiant compatibility.

